  "description": "Bring a calm and cozy winter feeling to your projects with this soft horizontal stripe seamless pattern. Light blue, gentle purple, and cool pastel shades create a snowy palette inspired by frosty weather, Christmas, and peaceful winter days. The simple repeating stripes are easy to incorporate into a wide range of seasonal creative projects, from printable paper to digital graphics and handmade designs.\n✨What’s Included:\n•15 seamless patterns\n•Format: JPEG\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n•High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n•Christmas and winter crafts\n•Holiday stationery\n•Scrapbooking and journaling\n•Gift wrapping and packaging\n•Fabric and textile designs\n•Cozy seasonal branding\n•Planner and digital paper designs\n•Canva and DIY projects",
